Package: PeakAnnotationAgent
Title: Peak Annotation and Pathway Analysis Runner
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Hua", "Huang", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reusable command-line framework for genomic peak annotation,
    pathway enrichment, and publication-ready figures using ChIPseeker,
    rGREAT, HOMER, clusterProfiler, Enrichr, DAVID, and Metascape-friendly
    exports.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
